# Testing

- Unit tests must not call real LLM APIs. Mock the LLM client.
- Policy tests run without LLM — deterministic and cheap.
- Tenant isolation: tenant A creates a case; tenant B GET by uuid → 404.
- Eval datasets live in `evals/datasets/`. Include failure and adversarial cases, not only happy path.
- Broken JSON from LLM → one retry, then case status `failed`.
- Run pytest (and evals when present) before considering a change complete.
